      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNLEASH BRADY (8) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts four wins and two placings. Hit the frame latest (28.81) when second at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has the ability and should feature. MYSTICAL ETHICS (1) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (28.84) at this track. A big run wouldn't surprise. ANGELIC ANGEL (7) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last five runs. Last time finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on October 8 over 520m at Wentworth Park behind He's Me Bowler beaten 4.5 lengths (30.01). Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from six starts. Will give a great sight again. EXCESSIVE WHEELS (2) is new here but should be in the mix.",
